# AnyStop Supabase Backend Configuration
# 1. Sign up or log into https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project (e.g. "AnyStop")
# 3. Go to Project Settings -> API to copy your Project URL and Anon Public Key
# 4. Copy this file to .env and replace the values below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
